## 🧩 Usage
```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Sumu28/Real-time-Language-Translation-Using-Neural-Machine-Translation-NMT-Bridging-Language-Barriers.git
cd Real-time-Language-Translation-Using-Neural-Machine-Translation-NMT-Bridging-Language-Barriers

# Create virtual environment & install dependencies
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate      # On macOS/Linux
# venv\Scripts\activate        # On Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run the translation interface
python app.py                  # or streamlit run app.py as applicable
